Java Collection Framework
The java collection framework provides a set of interface and classes to implementation various data structures and algorithm. These interface include several methods to perform different operations on collections.

          collection                Map             Iterator

List     set          queue        sortedMap         ListIterator

         sortedSet     Deque


Java Collection Interface

